WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.836
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Gym aur Fitness club ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:05.836 --> 00:00:08.373
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:08.373 --> 00:00:19.411
Gym ka business ek lead se shuru hota hai, phir membership bikti hai, aur uske baad sabse zaroori kaam hai member ko regular rakhna, is liye attendance aur renewal par nazar.

00:00:19.747 --> 00:00:21.446
Ye Members screen hai.

00:00:21.446 --> 00:00:28.938
Har member ke saamne uska plan aur halat: Active, Expires in chaar din, ya Expired das din pehle.

00:00:28.938 --> 00:00:35.039
Neeche har member ke buttons: Check in, Remind, Freeze, Renew aur Cancel. Kyun?

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:46.238
Kyunki gym ki asli kamai renewal se hoti hai, aur jo member ki membership khatam hone wali hai, use pehle se yaad dilana sabse fayde ka kaam hai.

00:00:46.611 --> 00:00:49.725
Naya member. Sell membership dabate hain.

00:00:49.725 --> 00:00:58.613
Naam Rohit Verma, mobile number, aur plan chunte hain: Monthly, Quarterly, Half yearly, Annual, ya Personal Training.

00:00:58.613 --> 00:01:04.765
Plan chunte hi amount aur khatam hone ki tareekh apne aap tay ho jaati hai. Kyun?

00:01:04.765 --> 00:01:11.222
Kyunki manually tareekh gin kar likhne mein galti hoti hai, aur member ka jhagda bhi.

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:18.787
Sell and generate invoice dabate hain. Invoice ban gaya aur member ka profile bhi ban gaya.

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:22.973
Ye invoice WhatsApp par bheja ja sakta hai, ya print.

00:01:22.973 --> 00:01:29.291
Dekhiye, final result: naya member, uska GST invoice, aur membership ki tareekh.

00:01:29.671 --> 00:01:35.367
Plans. Yahan aap apne membership plan tay karte ho: naam, kitne din, aur kitne rupaye.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:40.003
Personal Training jaise plan mein kitne sessions milenge ye bhi. Kyun?

00:01:40.003 --> 00:01:48.282
Kyunki alag alag customer alag alag budget ke hote hain, aur plan ek jagah badalne se har nayi sale mein wahi rate lagta hai.

00:01:48.652 --> 00:01:49.380
Attendance.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:57.187
Yahan abhi gym mein kitne log hain, aaj ke check in, aur pichhle tees din ka sabse busy ghanta, jaise dopahar do baje.

00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:01.422
Neeche wo sab jo abhi andar hain, aur Check out ka button. Kyun?

00:02:01.422 --> 00:02:06.583
Kyunki bheed ka time pata ho to trainer aur machines ki tayyari sahi hoti hai.

00:02:07.397 --> 00:02:12.528
Kisi member ko check in karna ho to search box mein naam ya phone likho.

00:02:12.528 --> 00:02:17.017
Rohit likhte hain aur usse chunte hain. Check in ho gaya. Kyun?

00:02:17.017 --> 00:02:23.288
Kyunki jiski membership khatam ho gayi ho, uski entry par yahi app turant bata deta hai.

00:02:23.662 --> 00:02:31.039
Classes. Hafte ke har din ka schedule: Morning Yoga, Zumba, Spin, HIIT, kitne baje aur kitne minute.

00:02:31.039 --> 00:02:40.482
Aaj ki class ke neeche booked members ki list, aur Book a member se kisi ko class mein jodne ka option, seats ki limit ke saath.

00:02:40.482 --> 00:02:45.793
Kyun? Kyunki class mein jagah se zyada log aa jayein to jhagda hota hai.

00:02:46.167 --> 00:02:50.019
Leads. Jo log gym ke baare mein poochte hain, unke liye.

00:02:50.019 --> 00:02:58.341
Har lead ka source, jaise Instagram, walk-in, Google ya friend, aur uska stage: New, Contacted, Trial, Converted ya Lost.

00:02:58.341 --> 00:03:03.843
Stage ek tap mein badalta hai, aur WhatsApp ka button seedha message kholta hai.

00:03:03.843 --> 00:03:06.663
Converted lead par Sell membership. Kyun?

00:03:06.663 --> 00:03:14.298
Kyunki jo poochne wala kal tak yaad rehta hai, wo parso bhool jata hai, aur lead bhoolne ka matlab paisa jaana.

00:03:15.329 --> 00:03:16.639
Self check in kiosk.

00:03:16.639 --> 00:03:23.385
Ek link hai jo aap kisi purane tablet ya phone par kholkar entrance par rakh do, bas itna hi setup hai.

00:03:23.385 --> 00:03:27.380
Member khud apna number daal kar check in kar leta hai. Kyun?

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:33.340
Kyunki reception par line nahi lagti, aur staff ko har member ko check in nahi karna padta.

00:03:33.701 --> 00:03:39.208
Aur Member profile mein workout aur diet plan. Suresh Patil ko kholte hain.

00:03:39.208 --> 00:03:46.990
Overview mein height, weight aur trainer. Workout tab mein uski exercise, kitne sets, reps aur rest. Kyun?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:53.672
Kyunki member ko sirf machine nahi, plan chahiye, aur yahi plan use gym se jode rakhta hai.

00:04:08.733 --> 00:04:15.709
Diet tab mein khane ka plan: subah ka nashta, lunch, workout ke baad aur dinner, calories ke saath.

00:04:15.709 --> 00:04:22.051
Aur Progress tab mein weight aur body fat ki entries, jo graph ki tarah dikhti hain. Kyun?

00:04:22.051 --> 00:04:26.984
Kyunki jab member ko apni tarakki dikhti hai, to wo renewal karta hai.

00:04:27.357 --> 00:04:40.081
Aaj humne Gym ka flow dekha: members aur unki halat, membership sell karna, plans, attendance aur check in, classes, leads, self check in kiosk, aur workout aur diet plan.

00:04:40.081 --> 00:04:46.927
Ek practical baat: har hafte Members screen par Expires in wali list dekho aur Remind dabao.

00:04:46.927 --> 00:04:51.168
Renewal yaad dilana naye member laane se kaafi sasta hai.
